<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n9402" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀντᾰκούω</span></b> , fut.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ούσομαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Aj.</u>
					1141
				</span></i>
			, <i>hear in turn,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀντὶ τῶν εἰρημένων ἴσ᾽ ἀντάκουσον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>OT</u>
					544
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἅ. γ᾽ εἶπας ἀντήκουσας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Heracl.</u>
					1014
				</span></i>
			 (cj.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κἀμοῦ νῦν ἀντάκουσον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Supp.</u>
					569
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀντακούσει τοῦτον ὡς τεθάψεται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Aj.</u>
					1141
				</span></i>
			: abs., <i>listen in return,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. ἐν μέρει</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Eu.</u>
					198
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Crates Com.
				5D.
			</span></i>: also in Prose, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>An.</u>
				2.5.16
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Lib.
				<u>Decl.</u>
				5.89
			</span></i>.</div>
